================================================================================================
CONFORMANCE RUN -- razorpay-woocommerce
================================================================================================
events under test : payment.authorized + refund.created
legal schedules   : 2 (vendor states delivery order is not guaranteed)

  P1 order independence
    payment.authorized then refund.created         -> wc-refunded
    refund.created then payment.authorized         -> wc-processing
    -> RED  (38.9s)

  P2 duplicate tolerance
    baseline                       -> {'order_status': 'wc-refunded', 'refund_count': 1, 'refunded_total': '499.00'}
    redelivered                    -> {'order_status': 'wc-refunded', 'refund_count': 1, 'refunded_total': '499.00'}
    -> GREEN  (41.3s)

  P4 no silent loss
    accepted=['payment.authorized', 'refund.created']  stored=['payment.authorized']  terminal=wc-pending  queue=2
    !! queue row marked consumed (cron_status=2) while the order never left pending
    !! the drain re-selects only cron_status=0, so this event is never retried
    -> RED  (18.2s)

  P5 amount integrity
    order total vs amount paid mismatched -> terminal=wc-processing
    !! order reached a paid state despite the amount not matching
    -> RED  (14.2s)

================================================================================================
OVERALL: RED   (strict worst-case aggregation -- one RED makes the run RED)
  P1-ORDER-INDEPENDENCE    RED
  P2-DUPLICATE-TOLERANCE   GREEN
  P4-NO-SILENT-LOSS        RED
  P5-AMOUNT-INTEGRITY      RED
  P3-EVENT-ID-DEDUP        YELLOW
================================================================================================
report -> rig/out/conformance_report.json
